## Threat model (summary)

| Threat | Mitigation |
|--------|------------|
| Prompt-injected destructive Flink ops | Writes off; approval + policy + scopes |
| Path injection in REST URLs | `Inputs.requireId` / `requireInt` |
| Local file exfil via upload_jar | Directory allow-list |
| Token replay | Nonce store + TTL |
| Secret leakage in tool output | DLP redaction + size bound |
| Unauthenticated HTTP MCP | Fail-closed Bearer |
| Log/protocol mix-up | stderr-only logging |

